summary: Test NVIDIA driver upgrades
description: |
  Verify that installing the default NVIDIA stack over an older installation
  upgrades the driver and companion packages and installs the matching kernel
  module while preserving unrelated packages. Use mock RPMs to exercise the
  upgrade without requiring NVIDIA hardware or functional drivers. Older
  kernel modules remain installed for existing kernels.
order: 52
require:
  - dnf-plugins-core
  - type: library
    nick: radii
    name: /Library/mock-rpms
